# Bobiverse ebook manifest
#
# The books themselves are gitignored and unrecoverable from git — this file
# is how you check that a copy restored from backup is the SAME copy. It does
# not protect anything; keep the real backup off this disk.
#
# Editions differ in how they mark up chapter headers, and a different edition
# can silently renumber chapters and break every citation in data/bobs.json.
# That is what the chapter and word counts are for.
#
#   sha256sum -c books/MANIFEST.sha256    # hashes only, no tooling needed
#   make verify-books                     # hashes AND what they parse to
#
# = bobiverse-1-we-are-legion.epub | book 1 | 61 chapters | 91034 words | 383701 bytes | 2016 EPUB — chapter headers are <li value=n>, not <p>
# = bobiverse-2-for-we-are-many.epub | book 2 | 77 chapters | 83524 words | 386584 bytes | EPUB — headers as paragraphs
# = bobiverse-3-all-these-worlds.epub | book 3 | 74 chapters | 72427 words | 336827 bytes | EPUB — headers as paragraphs
# = bobiverse-4-heavens-river.epub | book 4 | 67 chapters | 157099 words | 592258 bytes | EPUB — headers as paragraphs; numbering restarts at part 2
# = bobiverse-5-not-till-we-are-lost.epub | book 5 | 72 chapters | 97540 words | 553665 bytes | EPUB — headers as paragraphs; word-numeral chapter titles
#
c875aea7d6d183ee2e08ac848137f70e0a0e4f745501487c7ca97cf1e820e1da  bobiverse-1-we-are-legion.epub
